{"id":"15f80240a42e9796","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-model-theory-truth.md","title":"真理模型论","display":"df-model-theory-truth — 真理模型论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-model-theory-truth","aliases":["91-df-model-theory-truth","91-df-truth-model-theory","91-df-semantics-truth"],"display":"df-model-theory-truth — 真理模型论","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-model-general]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-model-theory-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-model-theory-truth</span><span>91-df-truth-model-theory</span><span>91-df-semantics-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-model-theory-truth — 真理模型论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c38d15bb3c121301\" href=\"?note=c38d15bb3c121301\" title=\"91-df-truth-model-general\">91-df-truth-model-general</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-model-theory-truth-—-真理模型论-$\\mathrm{MTTruth}$\">df-model-theory-truth — 真理模型论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MTTruth}\">\\(\\mathrm{MTTruth}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\)</span> (真理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vDash_\\star\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L_T)\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\vDash_\\star\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L_T)\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>\n(固定的经典或指定值满足关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}_\\star(\\mathcal T_T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathfrak M\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L_T)\\mid\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathcal T_T\\;(\\mathfrak M\\vDash_\\star\\sigma)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Mod}_\\star(\\mathcal T_T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathfrak M\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L_T)\\mid\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathcal T_T\\;(\\mathfrak M\\vDash_\\star\\sigma)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model\\text{-}theory\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MTTruth}(\\mathcal T_T,\\vDash_\\star)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Mod}_\\star(\\mathcal T_T),\\vDash_\\star\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model\\text{-}theory\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MTTruth}(\\mathcal T_T,\\vDash_\\star)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Mod}_\\star(\\mathcal T_T),\\vDash_\\star\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MTTruth}\">\\(\\mathrm{MTTruth}\\)</span> : 真理的模型论方法</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}_\\star(\\mathcal T_T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}_\\star(\\mathcal T_T)\\)</span>：相对于所选满足关系的理论模型类</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vDash_\\star\">\\(\\vDash_\\star\\)</span>：须明确指定的经典、强 Kleene或其他满足关系</li>\n</ul>\n<p>模型论方法的组成部分：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部分</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>基础模型</td>\n<td>PA 的任意指定模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}\\)</span>；需要标准性时另行声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真理外延</td>\n<td>真句子集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>满足关系</td>\n<td>三值或经典满足</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>模型论与公理理论的对应：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公理理论</th>\n<th>模型论对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>TB/UTB</td>\n<td>任意的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal{M}, \\Gamma)\">\\((\\mathcal{M}, \\Gamma)\\)</span>满足T-schema</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>强 Kleene 固定点给出预期模型；不只限于最小固定点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VF</td>\n<td>通常借助超赋值式模型条件分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>不对应单一固定点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>模型论的核心定理：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>定理</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>固定点存在</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists \\Gamma\\;(\\Gamma = J(\\Gamma))\">\\(\\exists \\Gamma\\;(\\Gamma = J(\\Gamma))\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定点非唯一</td>\n<td>只对具有多个固定点的具体跳跃算子成立，不是定义公理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小固定点存在</td>\n<td>对完备格上的单调 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}=\\bigcap\\{X:J(X)\\subseteq X\\}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}=\\bigcap\\{X:J(X)\\subseteq X\\}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>模型构造的技术：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代构造</td>\n<td>从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset\">\\(\\emptyset\\)</span>迭代<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修正序列</td>\n<td>从假设<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{H}\">\\(\\mathcal{H}\\)</span>修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经典扩展</td>\n<td>三值模型到经典模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>模型论与一致性的关系：\n在足够可靠的元理论中，若存在相对于可靠语义的模型，则可推出相应理论的语法一致性；这一结论依赖满足关系的可靠性，不能同时混用经典与三值满足。</p>\n<p>模型论的哲学意义：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>意义</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>语义优先</td>\n<td>先定义语义，再匹配公理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型多样性</td>\n<td>多个固定点展示真理的多解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可靠性证明</td>\n<td>模型构造证明相对一致性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理解真理理论的模型论基础</li>\n<li>区分不同的模型论方法</li>\n<li>连接语义与公理理论</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-model-theory-truth-—-真理模型论-$\\mathrm{MTTruth}$","text":"df-model-theory-truth — 真理模型论 $\\mathrm{MTTruth}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-model-general","status":"resolved","id":"c38d15bb3c121301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-model-general]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{MTTruth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\vDash_\\star\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L_T)\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}_\\star(\\mathcal T_T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathfrak M\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L_T)\\mid\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathcal T_T\\;(\\mathfrak M\\vDash_\\star\\sigma)\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model\\text{-}theory\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MTTruth}(\\mathcal T_T,\\vDash_\\star)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Mod}_\\star(\\mathcal T_T),\\vDash_\\star\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MTTruth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}_\\star(\\mathcal T_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vDash_\\star","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathcal{M}, \\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists \\Gamma\\;(\\Gamma = J(\\Gamma))","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\min}=\\bigcap\\{X:J(X)\\subseteq X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{H}","display":false}],"bytes":2922